ri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_1015796854705822_8492664372743477664_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EVU5c4GGem4Q7kNvwFK4tF5&_nc_oc=AdpdnLjPJHTNDe4lLRGdS_MYyf2gPhcp168nD8gkUCNmrnZLb0tEk1vc0tz92h-Lsxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM6Y3I-vYgQ7WrHki3tTC58d1Xg8JKIfuabvBJvdRHadg&oe=6AD241F3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1542939507582843", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_1542939510916176_1067851692761548296_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W_Gbb9MX7L8Q7kNvwFK9sGS&_nc_oc=Adp3lHa6zO5emq6rmIeO4llBwsRm3BfxD5Saw_rLIUhwRQZECbvnLrTBoaHOtl8416E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPi7U3awmB8D-EwbTRf2mkNz2ybc53NctkZCxZW5vFWHg&oe=6AD25A33"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2547510602348365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_2547510605681698_6513688564463920965_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kq3QuO0Ejr0Q7kNvwEhMW6X&_nc_oc=Adqm7GhWy2jqaXWvANM_FObgJbiXilkVUer_Br4gwssbNqX2aJg1yrnTMoTWstEafjk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBS68yfRjM6wH3WnyFdPWkhAciSu2SfXG3XH89yaTPeg&oe=6AD24E3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "V5.png", "id": "1101891335612607", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623115_1101891338945940_6241356484317899138_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uuZtSZQPxbwQ7kNvwHd_F6U&_nc_oc=AdoZYzAWMlbMBoIwQsOE-0x1OvBURrLQS3xVbwSZaRjxS-nqVVtvZH08JAVcGq5qRcs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQME2aojYcKjBAC0Xdf-r4bslKv78e3wTefq2a_PF9n-nQ&oe=6AD256FC"}, "display_name": "Fit Drums: Rhythm Workout", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Rhythm", "Cardio", "Workout", "Beat"], "long_description": "# Turn Air Drumming into Your High-Intensity Cardio Routine! \u26a1   \nReady to rock your fitness goals? Fit Drums transforms energetic drumming into an addictive full-body exercise. Follow the beats, strike the drums positioned in 8 dynamic directions, and sculpt your muscles while losing yourself in the music!   \n\u3000\n# \ud83d\udd25Key Features:\n- \ud83c\udfb5 **8-Lane Circular Rhythm Exercise**: Test your coordination! Notes stream down 8 lanes arranged in a circle right in front of you. Strike the drums perfectly on time for a deeply satisfying, rhythm-driven workout.   \n- \ud83d\udcaa** Full UpperBody Training**: Engage your shoulders, back, and core. Moving your arms in every direction creates a high-energy workout that leaves your arms burning and your heart pumping.  \n- \ud83d\udcc8 **Calorie-Conscious Beats**: Check your post-fight summary to see how much energy you've burned. Track your daily progress and watch your fitness level soar with every song you master.    \n- \ud83d\ude4c **Controller-Free Drumming**: Experience ultimate freedom with Hand Tracking. No controllers needed\u2014your bare hands are your drumsticks. Punch and tap the air intuitively! \n- \ud83c\udfe0 **Your Room is the Concert (MR Mode)**: With Mixed Reality, the virtual drum kit and neon lanes seamlessly blend into your living room. Unleash your full rockstar energy safely without losing sight of your surroundings.   \nReady to drop the beat? Step up, grab your invisible sticks, and start drumming today! \ud83c\udfc6  \n", "short_description": "Feel the rhythm, beat the drums, and ignite your workout! \ud83e\udd41 Fit Drums is an exhilarating VR rhythm fitness game where your entire upper body becomes the instrument. Strike the notes as they rush down 8 circular lanes in perfect sync with high-energy tracks. Play with your bare hands, transform your room into a concert, and drum your way to peak fitness! \ud83c\udfc6  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": 